==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**7 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] on this stage are under buffed, so bringing any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie Cats]] like [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] or [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Heavyweight Cat]] will be completely fine.

